[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9723.67, "timestamp": "02:42:03", "text": "疯狂的。丹尼斯在干什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9726.07, "timestamp": "02:42:06", "text": "然后他儿子说：“不，我带来了这个。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9728.95, "timestamp": "02:42:08", "text": "预先抓捕。”是啊。哦，等等。哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9731.63, "timestamp": "02:42:11", "text": "我刚刚发现我的模型还没更新。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9735.67, "timestamp": "02:42:15", "text": "不在直播中。什么？什么？不，不，什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9738.91, "timestamp": "02:42:18", "text": "这样做就是日落吗？不。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9741.91, "timestamp": "02:42:21", "text": "关于这个游戏录制功能。我需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9743.95, "timestamp": "02:42:23", "text": "改变"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9748.469, "timestamp": "02:42:28", "text": "那。我需要改变这一点。我 我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9751.11, "timestamp": "02:42:31", "text": "直接展示我的东西。看看我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9753.03, "timestamp": "02:42:33", "text": "文件。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9755.338, "timestamp": "02:42:35", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yeah probably"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9756.19, "timestamp": "02:42:36", "text": "情况很糟糕。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9758.19, "timestamp": "02:42:38", "text": "坏的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9762.23, "timestamp": "02:42:42", "text": "坏的。我当时很害怕。那吓到我了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9765.389, "timestamp": "02:42:45", "text": "尽管。嗯，这吓到我了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9769.27, "timestamp": "02:42:49", "text": "关于风险投资那件事。我吓坏了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9770.71, "timestamp": "02:42:50", "text": "当时我就想，“等等，这声音在哪儿？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9773.309, "timestamp": "02:42:53", "text": "来自哪里？我是在看什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9776.55, "timestamp": "02:42:56", "text": "流？”然后我看了看"}]